{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11444","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11444/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11444/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11444/events","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11444","id":681067745,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2ODEwNjc3NDU=","number":11444,"title":"Undertow does not consider classes annotated by a handled type for ServletContainerInitializer","user":{"login":"eriklumme","id":29859656,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODU5NjU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29859656?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme","html_url":"https://github.com/eriklumme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eriklumme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":985346620,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5ODUzNDY2MjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1359391180,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzU5MzkxMTgw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/labels/area/undertow","name":"area/undertow","color":"0366d6","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/79","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/79","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/79/labels","id":5731018,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTczMTAxOA==","number":79,"title":"1.7.1.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":129,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-08-04T12:11:58Z","updated_at":"2020-10-01T14:41:53Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-08-27T07:36:28Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2020-08-18T14:01:45Z","updated_at":"2020-08-24T10:30:20Z","closed_at":"2020-08-19T07:57:46Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\nThe JavaDoc for the `javax.servlet.ServletContainerInitializer` states that the classes passed to `onStartup` should be\r\n\r\n> ... the Set of application classes that extend, implement, or have been annotated with the class types\r\nspecified by the {@link javax.servlet.annotation.HandlesTypes HandlesTypes} annotation ...\r\n\r\nHowever, the `io.quarkus.undertow.deployment.UndertowBuildStep#servletContainerInitializer` method only considers classes that extend or implement the class types, not ones that are annotated by it.\r\n\r\nSomething along these lines should probably be added\r\n\r\n    for (AnnotationInstance annotationInstance : combinedIndexBuildItem.getIndex()\r\n            .getAnnotations(typeName)) {\r\n        handledTypes.add(annotationInstance.target().asClass().name().toString());\r\n    }\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nIf a `ServletContainerInitializer` is annotated by `@HandlesTypes(Foo.class)`. where `Foo` is an annotation, classes annotated by this should be passed to its `onStartup` method.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\n\r\nClasses annotated by a handled type are not passed to the `onStartup` method.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Add the `quarkus-undertow` dependency\r\n2. Register a `ServletContainerInitializer` using SPI.\r\n3. Annotate it with `@HandlesTypes(<some-annotation>)`\r\n4. Add a class that is annotated by `<some-annotation>`, and that is discoverable by Quarkus.\r\n5. Debug the `onStartup` method, and see that the annotated class is not passed to it.","closed_by":{"login":"jaikiran","id":143523,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143523?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran","html_url":"https://github.com/jaikiran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11444/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}